# CastIronForge â€” Operator-Grade Research Automation System

CastIronForge is a deterministic, modular automation framework for:
- daily research logging
- ingestion pipelines
- multi-agent analysis
- semantic indexing
- clustering
- anomaly detection
- forecasting
- documentation generation

Templates in /templates are the single source of truth.
Scripts in /scripts are generated via build-all-scripts.ps1.
